5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I believe we should be thorough about the financial and physical constraints before we decide. I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I'm curious about how the desks actually feel! I'll look into the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I want to see how this actually affects our daily flow! I'll check the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and those unplanned seat shuffles from the past year.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take a look at the drawn plan against the staff survey and the arrival times in the badge records. Let's see if the current layout is actually based on reality or just a guess.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it's important to know how we interact. I'll look into the two project strands within earshot last spring and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
